{"task_id": "HumanEval/48", "solution": "def is_palindrome(text: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a given string is a palindrome.\n    It performs a case-sensitive and character-sensitive comparison.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not text:\n        return True  # An empty string is considered a palindrome.\n\n    left = 0\n    right = len(text) - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        if text[left] != text[right]:\n            return False\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n\n    return True"}
