{"task_id": "HumanEval/78", "solution": "def hex_key(num: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of hexadecimal digits that are primes.\n    Initializes dependencies and uses HexKeyCounterService to perform the count.\"\"\"\n    \n    # Constants: PRIME_HEX_DECIMAL_VALUES\n    # Responsibility: Centralizes the definition of constant values.\n    # Attributes: PRIME_HEX_DECIMAL_VALUES: Set[int]\n    # Collaborations: Used by PrimeChecker.\n    PRIME_HEX_DECIMAL_VALUES = {2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13}\n\n    # Class: HexDigitConverter\n    # Responsibility: Converts a single hexadecimal character to its decimal integer equivalent.\n    # Methods: to_decimal(hex_char: str) -> int\n    class HexDigitConverter:\n        def to_decimal(self, hex_char: str) -> int:\n            return int(hex_char, 16)\n\n    # Class: PrimeChecker\n    # Responsibility: Determines if a given integer is one of the predefined prime hexadecimal values.\n    # Attributes: _prime_values: Set[int]\n    # Methods: __init__(self, prime_hex_decimal_values: Set[int]), is_prime(decimal_value: int) -> bool\n    # Collaborations: Depends on Constants for its _prime_values set.\n    class PrimeChecker:\n        def __init__(self, prime_hex_decimal_values):\n            self._prime_values = prime_hex_decimal_values\n\n        def is_prime(self, decimal_value: int) -> bool:\n            return decimal_value in self._prime_values\n\n    # Class: HexKeyCounterService\n    # Responsibility: Orchestrates the process of counting prime hexadecimal digits in a given string.\n    # Attributes: _hex_digit_converter: HexDigitConverter, _prime_checker: PrimeChecker\n    # Methods: __init__(self, hex_digit_converter: HexDigitConverter, prime_checker: PrimeChecker), count_prime_hex_digits(self, hex_string: str) -> int\n    # Collaborations: Depends on HexDigitConverter and PrimeChecker.\n    class HexKeyCounterService:\n        def __init__(self, hex_digit_converter: HexDigitConverter, prime_checker: PrimeChecker):\n            self._hex_digit_converter = hex_digit_converter\n            self._prime_checker = prime_checker\n\n        def count_prime_hex_digits(self, hex_string: str) -> int:\n            prime_count = 0\n            for char in hex_string:\n                decimal_value = self._hex_digit_converter.to_decimal(char)\n                if self._prime_checker.is_prime(decimal_value):\n                    prime_count += 1\n            return prime_count\n\n    hex_digit_converter = HexDigitConverter()\n    prime_checker = PrimeChecker(PRIME_HEX_DECIMAL_VALUES)\n    hex_key_counter_service = HexKeyCounterService(hex_digit_converter, prime_checker)\n    return hex_key_counter_service.count_prime_hex_digits(num)"}
