{"task_id": "HumanEval/82", "solution": "import math\ndef prime_length(string):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the length of a string is a prime number.\n    Returns True if the string length is prime, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(string, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a string.\")\n            \n    n = len(string)\n    \n    # Inlined primality test logic\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n == 2:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    for i in range(3, int(math.sqrt(n)) + 1, 2):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n    return True"}
