{"task_id": "HumanEval/103", "solution": "def rounded_avg(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Computes the rounded binary average of integers from n through m.\n    Returns -1 if n is greater than m.\"\"\"\n    if n > m:\n        return -1\n\n    # Calculate the count of numbers in the range.\n    count = m - n + 1\n    # Calculate the sum using the arithmetic series formula.\n    sum_of_range = (count * (n + m)) // 2\n\n    # Calculate the floating-point average.\n    average = sum_of_range / count\n\n    # Round the average to the nearest integer, with .5 values rounding up.\n    rounded_value = int(average + 0.5)\n\n    # Convert the rounded integer to its binary string representation.\n    binary_string = bin(rounded_value)\n\n    return binary_string"}
