{"task_id": "HumanEval/128", "solution": "from typing import List, Optional\ndef prod_signs(arr: List[int]) -> Optional[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of magnitudes of integers multiplied by the product of all signs.\n    Returns None for an empty array.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not arr:\n        return None\n\n    def get_sign(n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Determines the sign of an integer.\"\"\"\n        if n > 0:\n            return 1\n        elif n < 0:\n            return -1\n        else:\n            return 0\n\n    def _calculate_sign_product(arr: List[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the product of signs, short-circuiting if a zero is encountered.\"\"\"\n        product_of_signs = 1\n        for num in arr:\n            sign = get_sign(num)\n            product_of_signs *= sign\n            if product_of_signs == 0:\n                return 0\n        return product_of_signs\n\n    def _calculate_magnitude_sum(arr: List[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of magnitudes for all integers.\"\"\"\n        sum_of_magnitudes = 0\n        for num in arr:\n            sum_of_magnitudes += abs(num)\n        return sum_of_magnitudes\n\n    product_of_signs = _calculate_sign_product(arr)\n    sum_of_magnitudes = _calculate_magnitude_sum(arr)\n\n    return sum_of_magnitudes * product_of_signs"}
