{"task_id": "HumanEval/132", "solution": "def is_nested(string):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a string of square brackets contains a valid nested subsequence.\n    A nested subsequence requires the bracket balance to reach 2 or more at some point.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_balance = 0\n    max_balance_achieved = 0\n\n    for char in string:\n        if char == '[':\n            current_balance += 1\n        elif char == ']':\n            current_balance -= 1\n        \n        max_balance_achieved = max(max_balance_achieved, current_balance)\n\n    return max_balance_achieved >= 2"}
